{"4196320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DepthWake", "steam_appid": 4196320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2628 The Return to Earth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/96378720fb8e3ae39716c0db603bbbf9.poster.avif?t=1781063964\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/96378720fb8e3ae39716c0db603bbbf9.webm?t=1781063964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/96378720fb8e3ae39716c0db603bbbf9.mp4?t=1781063964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Saturday 20th September 2628:</u></strong><br> You are sent back to Earth on a solo mission to gather untouched resources, build automated factories, and survive the mysteries of its long-abandoned oceans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Goals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gather - Collect valuable resources from the ocean floor and deep cave systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Craft - Upgrade your submarine, diving gear, and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Automate - Build systems to harvest, transport, and process resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survive: Endure pressure, darkness, hostile creatures, and the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/e43d1d426f1cf5c3bb22b0fa32bc6fd3.poster.avif?t=1781063964\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/e43d1d426f1cf5c3bb22b0fa32bc6fd3.webm?t=1781063964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/e43d1d426f1cf5c3bb22b0fa32bc6fd3.mp4?t=1781063964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To descend deeper, you must use the resources around you to upgrade your submarine, diving gear, and defensive systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and automate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from ocean caves and the seafloor to construct automated systems that harvest, transport, and process materials. Expand your operation, improve efficiency, and unlock new technologies that allow you to descend further into Earth’s abandoned oceans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in Earth’s familiar blue waters, you begin to discover that history did not tell the whole story. The deeper you descend, the more unsettling the ocean becomes. Harmless creatures may not be harmless. Old records may not be true. And something beneath the waves was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to uncover the truth hidden beneath the ocean — the truth history books never told?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/cbacbd7b05253b493bc1413fdb114b11.poster.avif?t=1781063964\" width=800 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/cbacbd7b05253b493bc1413fdb114b11.webm?t=1781063964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196320/extras/cbacbd7b05253b493bc1413fdb114b11.mp4?t=1781063964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p